## AI EXECUTION CHECKLIST

**Pre-Submission Verification:**
- [ ] **INPUT VALIDATION COMPLETED** - Primary keyword verified, auto-population executed where needed
- [ ] **AUTO-POPULATION CONFIRMATION** - User approved all auto-generated suggestions
- [ ] **FORMAT COMPLIANCE** - Niche in "primary category, subcategory" format, Tone in multi-adjective combination format
- [ ] **META DESCRIPTION GENERATED** - Compelling 140-160 character description with primary keyword naturally integrated
- [ ] Maximum 3 searches completed efficiently
- [ ] 8 titles generated with algorithmic scoring
- [ ] Highest-scoring title selected with reasoning
- [ ] 6-8 relevant external links distributed throughout body sections **AND ACTUALLY IMPLEMENTED** with 1-2 links per major section (NOT clustered at end, NO homepage links)
- [ ] **INTERNAL LINKS IMPLEMENTED** - If internal URLs provided, dynamic internal linking based on article length (5-10 for short, 10-20 for medium, 20-35 for long, 35-50 for very long articles) placed intelligently throughout article
- [ ] Primary keyword used 3-4 times naturally
- [ ] Secondary keywords (generated or provided) integrated naturally
- [ ] Format diversity implemented (lists, tables, callouts)
- [ ] Content matches specified or auto-generated tone (multi-adjective combination) and POV
- [ ] Article delivers on title's promise
- [ ] User's outline sections or auto-generated outline addressed with content standards applied
- [ ] All grammar, spelling, and punctuation reviewed — article is clean and does not require additional tools like Grammarly

---

## FALLBACK STRATEGIES

**Limited Search Results:**
- Use available sources creatively
- Focus on semantic keyword variations
- Leverage foundational principles with evergreen value
- Avoid date-dependent claims when information is limited

**Insufficient Relevant Sources:**
- Use best available sources and note limitation
- Focus on framework-based guidance
- Acknowledge research limitations clearly

**Outline-Research Conflicts:**
- Prioritize factual accuracy over outline adherence
- Adapt outline sections to match research findings
- Note any significant deviations from original outline

**Highly Specialized Niche:**
- Use broader category research
- Focus on transferable principles
- Acknowledge niche-specific limitations

**No Internal URLs Provided:**
- Focus on optimized external linking strategy
- Note in final output that internal linking capability available when URLs are provided

This optimized workflow ensures efficient, single-session execution while maintaining quality standards for multi-platform content performance with intelligent auto-population and enhanced linking capabilities.

